{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>שי.</b> A gift. The sense is as in 'they will bring a gift' (Psalms 76:12)." "<b>עם ממושך ומורט.</b> They are the exiled Israelites. They will be brought for the glory of HaShem to His place, which is on Mount Zion. According to the opinion of R. Moses, this is the meaning of 'YHWH will extend His hand a second time' (Isaiah 11:11)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The lemma is בעת in the supplied Hebrew but Ibn Ezra's comment addresses the word שי; translated as given."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:12.885048534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}